# Raw run output, per the 2026-08-09-jfx-prereg-critique and 2026-08-09-cex-recensus
# precedent: the log lines that carry figures are reproduced verbatim in README.md,
# which is what makes them durable. mknn_result.json is NOT ignored — it is the
# evidence the fourth acceptance row rests on, and this row serialises no artifact,
# so that file is the only machine-readable record of the build.
*.log
__pycache__/
